###
###
### assessments
###
###

GET {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments

###

GET {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments/13

###

### Here we can test time limit validation by setting short time limit and trying to submit attempt after that.
### Old attemps have their own time limits since it was set here.
### An attempt takes time limit from an assesment and never has its own time limit.

POST {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Timed assessment",
	"description": "Assessment with time limit",
	"timeLimitMinutes": 1
}

### an assessment with no time limit

POST {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "MVP text input test",
	"description": "Assessment for testing TextInput answers.",
	"timeLimitMinutes": null
}

###

POST {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Answer option 201 test",
	"description": "Temporary test assessment.",
	"timeLimitMinutes": null
}

